MdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1BEdhEs4okY8px0aUYl5pGKgth\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qq19dMU6toJzwOx3MdqlFu7eg8q\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>China v&agrave; United States l&agrave; những nước sản xuất v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ điện lớn nhất, trong đ&oacute; Trung Quốc dẫn đầu</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-STGBdnqdIo0lmuxIYtQlSlYcghg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hầu hết c&aacute;c quốc gia sản xuất nhiều điện hơn mức ti&ecirc;u thụ, ngoại trừ Đức.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D3Z8dJxDFozvIFx9RWwlVO1EgEd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FjzcdfjPIolAdExNXUtl99bKgSf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c nước sản xuất v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ điện lớn hơn (China, US, Russia, Japan v&agrave; India)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GxPWd37zxoTwfSxQjxllAOwGgee\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XsPFdTYauoXKODxKmzDlVsmTgMd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu China </strong><em>(sản xuất 5,398 billion Kwh - ti&ecirc;u thụ 5,322 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5thd5IjPoIQkVxpg2glaJ5Ngkh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu United States </strong><em>(sản xuất 4,099 billion Kwh - ti&ecirc;u thụ 3,866 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1yjd2zc7oj4TpxuA4zl8n5ygTc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu sản xuất v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ điện c&oacute; phần tương tự ở Russia </strong><em>(~1,057 billion), </em><strong>Japan</strong><em> (~936,2 billion) v&agrave; </em><strong>India</strong><em> (~871 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XiHpdqICqo1iIdx05wfllSxDg4b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c nước sản xuất v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ điện nhỏ hơn (Canada, France, Brazil, Germany, Korea)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mnn4ddnJBobQY1xt3snlg5WTggu\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JBoAdtXWGonhwOxAd0ilKeuOgLC\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu Canada, France v&agrave; Brazil </strong><em>(sản xuất từ 500 - 620 billion - ti&ecirc;u thụ từ 455 - 500 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZqAKdkxcPo2lkLx94xhlGFmIgJe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu Germany </strong><em>(sản xuất 526.6 billion Kwh - ti&ecirc;u thụ 582.5 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jv1Hd4U8moSnOBx6BCllTtBkgVJ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu Korea</strong><em> (sản xuất 485.1 billion Kwh - ti&ecirc;u thụ 449.5 billion)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KhfpdiL9Gocq52xLtzVlYAP3gJg\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể lưu lại một số c&aacute;ch diễn đạt c&oacute; thể được sử dụng khi n&oacute;i muốn diễn đạt về \"<strong>sản xuất v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ</strong>\" nh&eacute;</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SquxdGTQqodw3HxKOVoltQjbgyp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>produce and consume STH</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B6K5dDYwvobc9vxywVtlJpzKgOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>production and consumption of <strong>[số liệu]</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdP3dQcJQoeh0nx8j48l8uxzgCg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqXodM1lDot0EcxsKGSlZKZugIe\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UTJQdQW3royfEYx3UKulVpU2guc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>The United States ranked second, <strong>producing</strong> 4,099 billion kWh and <strong>consuming</strong> 3,866 billion kWh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K346d0hjSo8LXxxoBbwlXRx2g9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Russia came in third place with <strong>a production and consumption of 1,057 billion kWh</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
